{"title":"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 22","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/b/09b927bdaf5259cb9fcc6a9251d72ccd55c3f9ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x^3-9x^2+kx-12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"158\" height=\"16\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/f/37fb1d324dcbe00e34ae63ab8dad431052fbffd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-3$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />, then it is also divisible by:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/b/5/0b5f33381af787ee367c6bf6f8425a36402b34fd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 3x^2-x+4\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 3x^2-4\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 3x^2+4\\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 3x-4 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 3x+4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"612\" height=\"19\" />   \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/b/09b927bdaf5259cb9fcc6a9251d72ccd55c3f9ba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x^3-9x^2+kx-12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"158\" height=\"16\" /> is divisible by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/f/37fb1d324dcbe00e34ae63ab8dad431052fbffd9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x-3$\" width=\"41\" height=\"12\" />, then by the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Remainder_Theorem\" title=\"Remainder Theorem\">Remainder Theorem</a>, plugging in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> in the cubic results in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/0/7c0eb57f2a03ed1f2993a59257c06a51dfb10b1a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3 \\cdot 3^3 - 9 \\cdot 3^2 + 3k - 12 = 0\\]\" width=\"214\" height=\"16\" />\nCombine like terms to get\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/d/4/9d47f58aa8ef6e6f7ae18dbff024fb15861db496.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[3k - 12 = 0\\]\" width=\"92\" height=\"13\" />\nThus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/a/eeae143c5c9dbd376ffa1ffa8bdb93a58e8c9889.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"43\" height=\"13\" />.  The cubic is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/7/f/27f115cffd5fbb5ab5d0c5bf1ecd3936bb4add8d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3x^3-9x^2+4x-12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"157\" height=\"16\" />, and it can be factored (by grouping or synthetic division) into\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/4/824bdbe8f7221e29381ffc3001e4911791fc4370.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[(3x^2+4)(x-3)\\]\" width=\"125\" height=\"19\" />\nThus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/f/fffc7368e8e7b77c88b0b4bf732c88c60e27b439.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"42\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/z4-bFo2D3TU?list=PLZ6lgLajy7SZ4MsF6ytXTrVOheuGNnsqn&amp;t=2515\">https://youtu.be/z4-bFo2D3TU?list=PLZ6lgLajy7SZ4MsF6ytXTrVOheuGNnsqn&amp;t=2515</a> - AMBRIGGS\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_22&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME\" title=\"1961 AHSME\">1961 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1961 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1961\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_21\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 21\">Problem 21</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_23\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 23\">Problem 23</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1961_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1961 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\